        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954370/extras/8754cecd1711490257e7a066126aa0b7.poster.avif?t=1762527860\" width=582 height=242 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954370/extras/8754cecd1711490257e7a066126aa0b7.webm?t=1762527860\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954370/extras/8754cecd1711490257e7a066126aa0b7.mp4?t=1762527860\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Summer, 2009. Tough times without money in your pocket. So, without thinking much, you agreed to a side job that was offered to you after a short phone conversation.</strong><br><br><strong>It's simple: just show up, take some convoluted test, and get your well-deserved 300 bucks. </strong><br><strong>No more than half an hour of work, right?</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The 2000s vibe in all its glory.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Very easy puzzles, even a streamer can handle them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A tense atmosphere when you have no idea what will happen next.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lots of achievements for curious minds.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954370/extras/8a8d65782809b6e2281bcd51b96bf900.avif?t=1762527860\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954370/extras/8754cecd1711490257e7a066126aa0b7.poster.avif?t=1762527860\" width=582 height=242 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954370/extras/8754cecd1711490257e7a066126aa0b7.webm?t=1762527860\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954370/extras/8754cecd1711490257e7a066126aa0b7.mp4?t=1762527860\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Summer, 2009. Tough times without money in your pocket. So, without thinking much, you agreed to a side job that was offered to you after a short phone conversation.</strong><br><br><strong>It's simple: just show up, take some convoluted test, and get your well-deserved 300 bucks. </strong><br><strong>No more than half an hour of work, right?</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The 2000s vibe in all its glory.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Very easy puzzles, even a streamer can handle them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A tense atmosphere when you have no idea what will happen next.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lots of achievements for curious minds.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954370/extras/8a8d65782809b6e2281bcd51b96bf900.avif?t=1762527860\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>",
        "short_description": "&quot;I'm Not a Robot&quot; is an atmospheric horror with old-school 3D and dark humor, telling the story of quickly making $300 in a shady alley. Sounds safe, right? Grab an easy payday or uncover all the secrets of the dark cult that has taken over your small town.",
